retain all chemical bonds between both parts which existed before the structure was broken. In a conductive lattice structure, electrons and signals will continue to transfer between fragments. A coil with two double latch gates in series, which is physically broken between the series, will retain the ability to transfer buffers between the series. The first buffer is transfered via chemical signalling between the two segments. One end of the severed coil can be shipped to remote locations to deliver personell, deliverables, fuel, electricity, etc. The remote transfer gates work as escape hatches on submarines, aircraft, space missions, etc. Power from wind and hydro can be transferred to vessels and batteries to replace nuclear power, tritium, and Pycnogonida.","topics":[],"score":193687,"global_rank":336058},{"name":"BenaroyaResearch/countSubsetNorm","owner":"BenaroyaResearch","html_url":"https://github.com/BenaroyaResearch/countSubsetNorm","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"R","description":"Helper functions to conduct subsetting and normalization of RNAseq data. Most of them are wrappers to facilitate workflows.","topics":[],"score":193682,"global_rank":336060},{"name":"vfragoso/transformations_labs","owner":"vfragoso","html_url":"https://github.com/vfragoso/transformations_labs","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"CMake","description":"Skeleton to implement different linear transformations in C++. This lab belongs to the CS 470 Introduction to Computer Graphics class at WVU.","topics":[],"score":193682,"global_rank":336062},{"name":"Wind010/CommonPowershellUtilities","owner":"Wind010","html_url":"https://github.com/Wind010/CommonPowershellUtilities","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"PowerShell","description":"Powershell scripts containing utilities such as logging and TFS API calls.","topics":[],"score":193682,"global_rank":336069},{"name":"natetan/hello-ios","owner":"natetan","html_url":"https://gi